#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD2238 expect=skipped domain=CM
#note "No CMSTTPT column -> Requirements.Variables.All [--STTPT] rejects (auditable skip). The [DE, DT, DX, EC, HO, PR] Domains.Exclude block is sheet-exact but not separately pinned - CM/AE cover the live classes and the block's members are largely non-base-IG tokens (DE/DT/DX) plus EC/HO/PR; the batch pins one exclude-block per distinct set and this rule's set has no twin-discriminating force beyond SD1293/SD0041's already-pinned mechanism."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset CM class=INTERVENTIONS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col CMSEQ    type=Num
col CMTRT    type=Char
col CMSTDTC  type=Char
---
S1 | CM | 001 | 1 | ASPIRIN | 2020-01-15
---
